    "S690 SHS60x4","S690 CHS139.7x5","S690 CHS139.7x5",
    "S690 CHS48.3x3.2","S690 CHS42.4x3.2","S690 CHS60.3x3.2",
    "S690 SHS60x4","S690 CHS139.7x5","S690 CHS139.7x5",
